# {{title}}

An Umbel pack plugin: content with no code. It ships one pack, `starter`, and one skill,
`{{id}}-guide`.

```sh
umbel plugin check path=.      # the manifest, the pack, the skill, and a boot of an internal host
```

To deploy, copy this directory to `plugins/{{id}}/` in a workspace and set
`plugins.enabled = ["{{id}}"]` in `umbel.toml`. A space can replace the pack whole with
`spaces/<space>/packs/{{id}}/starter/`; files are never merged.
